  "prefLabel": "Home 401.01 Expirations and Renewals",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Home 401.01 Expirations and Renewals. Pursuant to RSA 310-A:192, licenses shall be renewed by written application prior to the expiration date and by payment of the prescribed renewal fee. The board shall notify each home inspector one month prior to expiration of their license. If properly renewed, a license shall remain in effect continuously from the date of issuance, unless suspended or revoked by the board.\n\nSource. #9506, eff 7-8-09; ss by #12463, eff 1-23-18",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/home100-600.html"
